            <div class="text">
                <h2 class="heading text-center border-0 mb-0" style="font-size:23px;">STRATEGIC GROWTH PLAN (2025–2030)</h2>
                <h3 class="heading text-center border-0 mb-0" style="font-size:18px;">Bharat Ratna Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar Rajkiya Engineering College, Pratapgarh</h3>
                <p class="text-center mt-0"style="font-size:18px;"><i>Empowering Innovation and Driving Societal Impact</i></p>

                <h3 class="heading">VISION ALIGNMENT</h3>
                <p class="text">This plan advances the institutional vision to be a nationally recognized college of engineering and technological education, fostering innovation, interdisciplinary research, and societal contribution, particularly in AI, Smart Systems, and Emerging Technologies.</p>

                <h3 class="heading">1. ACADEMIC TRANSFORMATION & PROGRAM EXPANSION</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Deliver future-ready, interdisciplinary education across UG/PG levels.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <b>Curriculum Modernization:</b>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Integrate AI, ML, IoT, Cloud Computing, Cybersecurity, and Smart Fabrication into core curricula.</li>
                            <li>Emphasize project-based, experiential learning with real-world problems.</li>
                            <li>Adopt credit-based flexible curricula allowing cross-disciplinary electives.</li>
                            <li>Minor degree programs in emerging areas for interdisciplinary knowledge and skills.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>New Academic Programs at UG level in CSE</b>
                        <ul>
                            <li>B Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning)</li>
                            <li>B Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (IoT and Cyber Security including Block Chain technology)</li>
                            <li>B Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (Artificial Intelligence and Data Science)</li>
                            <li>B Tech in Information Technology</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>New Academic Programs at PG level in each discipline of CSE/EE/CE/ME:</b>
                        <ul>
                            <li>M.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (AI and DS)</li>
                            <li>M.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering (Big Data Analytics)</li>
                            <li>M.Tech in Smart Power & Renewable Systems (EE)</li>
                            <li>M.Tech in Civil Engineering (Environmental Engineering)</li>
                            <li>M.Tech in Advanced Manufacturing & Robotics (ME)</li>
                            <li>Honors and Minor Tracks in Entrepreneurship, AI, or Sustainable Development.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="heading mt-3">2. RESEARCH & INNOVATION ECOSYSTEM</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Establish REC as a center for applied, interdisciplinary, and socially impactful research.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <b>Research Groups of Department:</b>
                        <ul>
                            <li><b>CSE:</b> AI for healthcare, Agriculture, Smart Transportation, NLP, Cyber-physical systems</li>
                            <li><b>EE:</b> Smart Grid, EV Charging Systems, Embedded AI</li>
                            <li><b>CE:</b> Climate-resilient infrastructure, GIS for planning, Smart sanitation</li>
                            <li><b>ME:</b> Mechatronics, 3D Printing, Green Manufacturing</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <b>Centers of Excellence:</b>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Center for AI and Smart Systems</li>
                            <li>Center for Energy & Sustainable Infrastructure</li>
                            <li>Robotics and Automation Innovation Hub</li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li><b>Collaborative Research:</b> Partner with IITs/IIITS/NITs, DRDO, CSIR, and other national/international research bodies. Apply for grants under DST, SERB, AIM, AICTE-RPS.</li>
                    <li><b>Publication and IP Culture:</b> Incentivize journal publications, patents, and proof-of-concept prototypes.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="heading mt-3">3. INDUSTRY INTEGRATION AND INNOVATION TRANSFER</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Develop industry-responsive graduates and tech-driven solutions.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Industry-Academia Councils for each department.</li>
                    <li>Live industrial projects, co-designed labs, and on-site training/internships.</li>
                    <li>Skill certification programs via industry partners.</li>
                    <li>RECP Technology Innovation & Transfer Office (RECP-TITO) for IP licensing and product incubation.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="heading mt-3">4. STUDENT CENTRIC LEARNING & EMPOWERMENT</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Build leadership, technical expertise, and ethical grounding in every student.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>REC Skill & Innovation Hub:</b> Workshops on communication, AI tools, coding camps, startup bootcamps, hackathons.</li>
                    <li><b>Global Exposure:</b> Virtual internships, joint degrees, IAESTE, AICTE-INAE internships, AI-for-India challenges.</li>
                    <li><b>Wellness & Career Services:</b> Support for GATE, CAT, GRE, UPSC and mental health.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="heading mt-3">5. DIGITAL & PHYSICAL INFRASTRUCTURE MODERNIZATION</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Create a sustainable, digitally advanced learning ecosystem.</pclass="text">
                <ul>
                    <li>Smart Classrooms & Virtual Labs in all departments.</li>
                    <li>AI-driven LMS for personalized learning pathways.</li>
                    <li>High-Performance Computing (HPC) Lab for data-intensive projects.</li>
                    <li>Campus-wide IoT-enabled infrastructure for resource monitoring.</li>
                    <li>Green Campus Drive: solar energy, rainwater harvesting, zero-waste initiatives.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="heading mt-3">6. SOCIETAL INNOVATION & REGIONAL DEVELOPMENT</h3>
                <p class="text"><b>Goal:</b> Solve real-world problems through student-faculty innovation.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Community Innovation Labs</li>
                    <li>Low-cost devices for rural health and agriculture</li>
                    <li>Smart classroom kits for rural schools</li>
                    <li>Partner in Unnat Bharat Abhiyan, Jal Shakti Mission, and National Digital Health Mission</li>
                    <li>Social Innovation Challenge for students</li>
                </ul>

