                <p class="text"><b>This strategic plan aims to reestablish REC Pratapgarh</b> as a forward-thinking, research-driven, and socially responsible technical institution, deeply integrated with the realities of the digital world and national development goals.</p>
                <p class="text"><b>Under the visionary leadership of Prof. Y. N. Singh,</b> this roadmap ensures the Institute not only adapts to technological changes but leads them with purpose and impact.</p>

